2 CONC s 1892 marriage names father Charles Shape, box maker. William was a s
2 CONC ugar boiler in 1891 and at marriage. Two William Charles Shafe births 
2 CONC were registered in 1868, so the correct civil birth entry remains to b
2 CONC e resolved. Family recollection: very tall, had brothers, and ran a Lo
2 CONC ndon business making boxes and packing cases; recollections of his age
2 CONC  and death date conflict and need documentary checking.
